  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> strong divination; <strong>CL</strong> 13th; <strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 42,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p>This thin, strange, jagged piece of glass is about 1 foot long. When any creature looks through the Leng glass, it sees brief glimpses of random other places in the universe and in other planes of existence. A viewer can control the glass for 1 minute with a successful DC 20 Profession (Yog-Sothothery philosopher) skill check. The location viewed is a random one within 1d100-1 miles of the desired location. Once a viewer has successfully controlled the glass, that viewer can't control it again for 1 day.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction</strong><br>\n<strong>Cost</strong> 21,000 gp; <strong>Requirements</strong> Craft Wondrous Item, greater scrying</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythos-magic-items-and-artifacts#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
